extras/1a06f4f9cb7acdac06aad19a3d88136f.avif?t=1749380861\" /></div>Level up, learn new abilities, and use the Job system to customize your party</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">to gain an advantage against your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock different endings depending on which of the girls you decide to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">romance and the choices you make on your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342090/extras/729d683c6d5c77d3f71a74c4903080f0.avif?t=1749380861\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342090/extras/17cb3e98a2c8a552392bd6a29aa93aa3.avif?t=1749380861\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342090/extras/7d06bb7a12a310356fbd5b600fa048e0.avif?t=1749380861\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1342090/extras/9e7de6ae4c995d9466df75cad8b6c6c8.avif?t=1749380861\" /></div><strong>A Fantasy Role-Playing Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up and equip your heroes to overcome powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Varied Job System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick which job suits your needs. Learn unique abilities to turn your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">party into monster-killing machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Large World to Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the main quest through many different lands and unlock side quests along the way.</p>",
